{"id":"f28d9b3f22314622","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md","title":"内外否定与内外定理的差异","display":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外否定与内外定理的差异","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference","aliases":["91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference","91-df-internal-external-logic","91-df-logic-duality"],"display":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外否定与内外定理的差异","depends_on":["[[91-df-internal-logic]]","[[91-df-external-logic]]","[[91-df-internal-negation]]","[[91-df-external-negation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference</span><span>91-df-internal-external-logic</span><span>91-df-logic-duality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inner-outer-logic-difference — 内外否定与内外定理的差异"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9f50803c6dbd04e\" href=\"?note=c9f50803c6dbd04e\" title=\"91-df-internal-logic\">91-df-internal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d8969c7b834f5a6\" href=\"?note=0d8969c7b834f5a6\" title=\"91-df-external-logic\">91-df-external-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e369e02605242bf1\" href=\"?note=e369e02605242bf1\" title=\"91-df-internal-negation\">91-df-internal-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2c8fb2a4f3910429\" href=\"?note=2c8fb2a4f3910429\" title=\"91-df-external-negation\">91-df-external-negation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为真理理论；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm in}(\\varphi)=T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm in}(\\varphi)=T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm out}(\\varphi)=\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm out}(\\varphi)=\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}outer\\text{-}logic\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\nS\\nvdash[\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm in}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm out}(\\varphi)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}outer\\text{-}logic\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\nS\\nvdash[\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm in}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm out}(\\varphi)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogicDiff}(S)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Int}(S)\\ne\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Ext}(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LogicDiff}(S)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Int}(S)\\ne\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Ext}(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是两个不同的性质：前者检查否定双条件，后者检查定理集。FS 的组合否定公理给出全部否定实例，其定理规则也给出内外定理集相等；旧版表格说 FS 无法断言内外一致不符合 Definition 14.4。\nKF 的经典闭合模型可同时满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\">\\(\\neg T\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\">\\(\\neg T\\ulcorner\\neg\\lambda\\urcorner\\)</span>，而其部分模型把说谎者留为间隙。不能把经典的非成员判断与部分语义否定混合。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 14.4；§15.2；§20.2，印刷页 147、198–202、281–285。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-internal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"c9f50803c6dbd04e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0d8969c7b834f5a6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-external-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-internal-negation","status":"resolved","id":"e369e02605242bf1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-negation","status":"resolved","id":"2c8fb2a4f3910429","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-external-negation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm in}(\\varphi)=T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm out}(\\varphi)=\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inner\\text{-}outer\\text{-}logic\\text{-}difference}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{InOutDiff}_S(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\land\nS\\nvdash[\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm in}(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\rm out}(\\varphi)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogicDiff}(S)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Int}(S)\\ne\\operatorname{Log}_{\\rm Ext}(S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg T\\ulcorner\\lambda\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg T\\u